    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612750/extras/7b18c3564ff5ddd323d67d3512e93283.poster.avif?t=1695698861\" width=506 height=265 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612750/extras/7b18c3564ff5ddd323d67d3512e93283.webm?t=1695698861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>In the midst of a lengthy slumber, <strong>Box</strong> and their friend are disturbed by a colossal silhouetted figure. As this giant snatches Box\u2019s friend, it knocks our hero off their perch, awakening them as they scramble to save their friend. To reach them, <strong>Box</strong> will need to jump in and out of containers filled with family's mementos, the power of the nostalgic memories held within transforms each interior into full living, breathing worlds shaped by the metaphorical representation of these once happy childhood memories.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612750/extras/0ee692049ada1bd9bec5abfb93b7a90c.poster.avif?t=1695698861\" width=506 height=265 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612750/extras/0ee692049ada1bd9bec5abfb93b7a90c.webm?t=1695698861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relive memories from a new perspective as you:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Run, jump and bounce along a plethora of platforms <br></li><li> Solve puzzles to help the creatures in each chapter<br></li><li> Collect packaging peanuts to unlock collectibles<br></li><li> Customise your <strong>BOX</strong> and get them looking ready for the journey ahead</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612750/extras/65c962f0f0d00b32df39f9ac636cf3f3.poster.avif?t=1695698861\" width=506 height=265 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2612750/extras/65c962f0f0d00b32df39f9ac636cf3f3.webm?t=1695698861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
